Your dating QA

After any opportunity, ask yourself only these 4 questions:

Exposure: Did I put myself somewhere I could plausibly meet someone?
Interest: If I liked someone, did I allow some indication that I liked them?
Reciprocity: Did I notice and respond when they gave me attention, teasing, warmth, or an invitation?
Follow-through: If there was mutuality, did I make a reasonably clear next-step suggestion?
